{"articleNo":"2272","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2272&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"■ 2009년도 우리대학교 직장예비군교육훈련안내(수정)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.05.29","hit":"25982","attachments":[{"name":"3조(7월14일).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2272&attachNo=1468"},{"name":"6조(7월17일).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2272&attachNo=1469"},{"name":"5조(7월16일).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2272&attachNo=1675"},{"name":"2조(7월13일).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2272&attachNo=1908"},{"name":"4조(7월15일).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2272&attachNo=2687"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment--></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009년도 우리대학교 직장예비군교육훈련안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">훈련통지서 수령기간 : 2009. 6. 1～12일까지(해당 학부/과)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 훈련장소 : 제 120보병연대 1대대훈련장(고아읍 송림리)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">집결장소 및 시간 : 훈련당일 08 : 20분까지 정문 주차장</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※개인승용차를 이용하는 학생은 훈련장에 09:00분까지 도착</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 학부별 훈련 일정표</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#f2f2f2\" height=\"42\" valign=\"top\" width=\"101\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;구분</p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;일자</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#f2f2f2\" height=\"42\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">대상</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#f2f2f2\" height=\"42\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"416\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">학 급 편 성</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"101\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">계</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">3,200</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"416\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">대학원, 7개학부, 1개과, 교원</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"101\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 3.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">5월30일(휴일)</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">250</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"416\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">희망인원 250명 </p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"101\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 3.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">7월13일</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">590</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"416\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">기계공학부 590명</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"101\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 3.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">7월14일</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">590</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"416\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">기계공학부 80명, 컴퓨터공학부 350명, 전자공학부 160명</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"101\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 3.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">7월15일</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">590</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"416\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">전자공학부 450명, 토목환경공학부 140명</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"101\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 3.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">7월16일</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">590</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"416\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">토목환경공학부 50명, 건축학부 110명, 산업공학 130명,</p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">고분자 120명, 나바텍 40명, 정보나노 140명. </p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"101\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 3.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">7월17일</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">590</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"416\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">정보나노 190명, 자연과학부 150명, 산업경영 75명,</p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">대학원 170명, 교수 5명</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. 훈련 소집통지서는 각 학부(과)에서 수령하고 수령증은 반드시 날인 반납할 것.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">개인별 훈련일자 및 편성분대는 학교 홈페이지에서 확인할 것.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">※ 유의사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">불참자는 보충훈</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">련(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2009.10.15)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">이 실시되며, 주소지의 보충훈련 주기가 맞을 경우 개인별로&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 전국단위훈련신청을 해서 받을 수도 있습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 예비군복, 모자, 전투화, 군용혁띠, 고무줄 필히 착용할 것.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">집결시간엄수(정문주차장 08:20분, 단 개인별 출발자는 09:00까지 훈련</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">장에 도착)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 개인증명 신분증 반드시 휴대(학생증, 주민등록증, 운전면허증)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">지연 도착자, 복장위반자, 신분증 미 휴대자는 불참조치 및 보충훈련실시</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 중식은 개인별 준비한다</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(식권은 총기 수령시 구매할 수 있슴 : 4,000원)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">단 군에서 지급되는 중식비(4,000원)와 교통비(3,000원)는 훈련 종료시 지급함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">※폰 번호 변경 또는 없는 학생은 반드시 수령증에 연락 가능한 번호 기록할 것</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">※전국단위훈련신청 : 학교 훈련기간 중에 훈련을 받을 수 없는 예비군은 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://www.yebigun1.mil.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">http://www.yebigun1.mil.kr</span></a><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">)에 들어가셔서 전국단위훈련을 신청을 해서 받을 수도 있습니다</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(학교훈련주기와 같을 경우 가능함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">※첨부파일 확인시 해당학부/과의 일자를 확인하시고 성명순으로 확인바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2009. 5. 29</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">예&nbsp; 비&nbsp; 군&nbsp; 연&nbsp; 대&nbsp; 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
